{
  "_comment": [
    "Every file, or part of a file, that a tool here writes wholesale -- one",
    "list, so nothing generated goes unlabelled or unchecked (practice:",
    "registry-source-of-truth; Morgan, 2026-09-29, strength: decided).",
    "precedent_check.py's generated-files-registered reads it: each entry's",
    "file exists and carries its label (a Markdown file's generated_by",
    "frontmatter, a JSON file's _generated_by key, or for a part the",
    "markers named), each entry with a `check` is current, and every",
    "tracked file that carries a label is listed here.",
    "",
    "Blocks inside hand-written documents (<!--gen:NAME--> ... <!--/gen:NAME-->)",
    "are NOT repeated here: tools/doc_sync.py's PAIRS is their one list, and",
    "doc_sync.py checks them."
  ],
  "files": [
    {"path": "MAP.md", "generated_by": "tools/build_views.py",
     "edit_instead": "practices/*.md", "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_views.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_views.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "GLOSSARY.md", "generated_by": "tools/build_views.py",
     "edit_instead": "practices/*.md", "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_views.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_views.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "AGENTS.md", "part": "<!-- BEGIN GENERATED: precedent-loader -->",
     "generated_by": "tools/build_views.py", "edit_instead": "practices/*.md",
     "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_views.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_views.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "todo/TODO.md", "generated_by": "tools/build_todo_index.py",
     "edit_instead": "todo/todo-*.md", "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_todo_index.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_todo_index.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "todo/CLOSED.md", "generated_by": "tools/build_todo_index.py",
     "edit_instead": "todo/todo-*.md", "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_todo_index.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_todo_index.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "gotchas/INDEX.md", "generated_by": "tools/build_gotcha_index.py",
     "edit_instead": "gotchas/gotcha-*.md", "regenerate": "python3 tools/build_gotcha_index.py",
     "check": ["tools/build_gotcha_index.py", "--check"]},
    {"path": "record/stale_branches.md", "generated_by": "tools/very_deep_check.py",
     "edit_instead": null, "regenerate": "python3 tools/very_deep_check.py",
     "check": null, "why_no_check": "a snapshot of live branches, rewritten by each very deep check run; nothing offline can say what it should read now"},
    {"path": "record/very-deep-check-ledger.json", "generated_by": "tools/very_deep_check.py",
     "edit_instead": null, "regenerate": "python3 tools/very_deep_check.py",
     "check": null, "why_no_check": "an append-only log each run adds itself to; there is nothing to regenerate it from"},
    {"path": "record/holistic-reads.json", "generated_by": "tools/very_deep_check.py",
     "edit_instead": null, "regenerate": "python3 tools/very_deep_check.py --record-read",
     "check": null, "why_no_check": "an append-only log of reads a session recorded; there is nothing to regenerate it from"}
  ]
}
